# Ensure shell scripts retain LF line endings when checked out on POSIX
# hosts, even when the working tree was last edited on Windows. Without
# this, `provision-creds.sh` checked out on Linux can fail with
# `bad interpreter: /usr/bin/env^M`.
#
# The executable bit cannot be set via .gitattributes — operators must run
#   git update-index --chmod=+x docker/nats/provision-creds.sh
# once before committing on a Windows clone, or use
#   git add --chmod=+x docker/nats/provision-creds.sh
*.sh        text eol=lf
*.bash      text eol=lf
*.creds     text eol=lf
